| geometria desada | ADMIN | R-16-04 | `stale` a col?locacions | `RingGeometryChanged` |
| col?locaci? creada/actualitzada | INSTRUCTOR/ADMIN | R-16-05 | `resolvedObstacles`, `warnings` | `PlacementCreated` / `PlacementUpdated` |
